  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b000001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# `src/app/qml/view/panels/sidebar`\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "`src/app/qml/view/panels/sidebar`"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 3,
      "raw": "## Role\n",
      "level": 2,
      "title": "Role"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 4,
      "end_line": 4,
      "raw": "This directory contains the visual sidebar hierarchy surface and the domain-specific wrappers that mount it.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 5,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "The directory is intentionally split between:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 9,
      "raw": "- one reusable visual host: `SidebarHierarchyView.qml`\n- inline helper controllers for selection, rename, note-drop, and bookmark visuals inside `SidebarHierarchyView.qml`\n- lightweight wrappers such as `HierarchyViewLibrary.qml`, `HierarchyViewProjects.qml`, and related domain panels\n",
      "items": [
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "one reusable visual host: `SidebarHierarchyView.qml`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "inline helper controllers for selection, rename, note-drop, and bookmark visuals inside `SidebarHierarchyView.qml`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "lightweight wrappers such as `HierarchyViewLibrary.qml`, `HierarchyViewProjects.qml`, and related domain panels",
          "checked": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b000008",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 10,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 11,
      "end_line": 11,
      "raw": "## Important Design Choice\n",
      "level": 2,
      "title": "Important Design Choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 12,
      "end_line": 13,
      "raw": "`SidebarHierarchyView.qml` is not expected to keep every interaction detail in the root object. Recent cleanup removed\nthe old sibling helper files and keeps the controller-style responsibilities as named inline `QtObject` helpers:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000011",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 14,
      "end_line": 17,
      "raw": "- `hierarchySelectionController`\n- `renameController`\n- `noteDropController`\n- `bookmarkPaletteController`\n",
      "items": [
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`hierarchySelectionController`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`renameController`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`noteDropController`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`bookmarkPaletteController`",
          "checked": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b000012",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 18,
      "end_line": 18,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 19,
      "end_line": 19,
      "raw": "This keeps the root sidebar view focused on composition, geometry, and signal forwarding.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000014",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 20,
      "end_line": 20,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 21,
      "end_line": 24,
      "raw": "The rename path is intentionally split between `SidebarHierarchyView.qml` and\n`renameController`: the controller owns the transaction, while the view owns the rendered\n`displayedHierarchyModel` snapshot so inline rename can hide only the visible label without dropping stable row\nidentity.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000016",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 25,
      "end_line": 25,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 26,
      "end_line": 27,
      "raw": "Each inline helper must initialize its required root dependencies explicitly. If those bindings are missing, QML can\nabort workspace route construction with required-property errors and show only the empty LVRS window background.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000018",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 28,
      "end_line": 28,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 29,
      "end_line": 29,
      "raw": "does not just rely on LVRS defaults anymore; it pushes the shared `LV.Hierarchy` surface onto a\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000020",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 30,
      "end_line": 30,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 31,
      "end_line": 31,
      "raw": "## Relationship To C++\n",
      "level": 2,
      "title": "Relationship To C++"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 32,
      "end_line": 32,
      "raw": "This directory talks to C++ almost entirely through:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000023",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 33,
      "end_line": 35,
      "raw": "- `IHierarchyController`-compatible objects\n- `HierarchyInteractionBridge`\n- `HierarchyDragDropBridge`\n",
      "items": [
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`IHierarchyController`-compatible objects",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`HierarchyInteractionBridge`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`HierarchyDragDropBridge`",
          "checked": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b000024",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 36,
      "end_line": 36,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 37,
      "end_line": 37,
      "raw": "That separation is what keeps domain-specific mutation logic out of the QML file itself.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000026",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 38,
      "end_line": 38,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000027",
      "kind": "html",
      "start_line": 39,
      "end_line": 39,
      "raw": "<a id=\"한국어\"></a>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000028",
